+  ["a quantity on a piece", /\b\d+\s*(left|remaining|sold|in stock)\b/i],
+  ["keepsakes as a currency", /\b(earn|earned|earning|collect|win|won|unlocks?|unlocked)\b[^.]{0,30}\b(points?|rewards?|perks?)\b|\bpoints? (balance|total)\b|\bredeem (it|them|your|now)\b/i],
+  ["a price written into the code instead of read from the shop", /₹\s?\d/],
