+  ["a promise of a free exchange or a guaranteed fit", /free (exchange|resiz|size change)|exchanges? (are|is) free|easy exchange|guaranteed fit|fit guaranteed|perfect fit, guaranteed/i],
+  ["a checkout called an order", /\b(your|my) orders?\b|order history|past orders/i, [/“View your order”/g]],
